      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.159075000000001,
        367.84944999999976,
        37.818399999999997,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "planning."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        64.182974999999999,
        356.59904999999975,
        263.00987500000014,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "9. August 2001: the CIA does not focus on information that"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.159075000000001,
        345.34864999999974,
        251.05120000000002,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Khalid Sheikh Mohammed is a key al Qaeda lieutenant or con-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.159075000000001,
        334.09824999999972,
        250.99482499999996,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "nect information identifying KSM as the “Mukhtar” mentioned"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.159075000000001,
        322.84784999999971,
        251.00712500000012,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "in other reports to the analysis that could have linked"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.159075000000001,
        311.5974499999997,
        208.04220000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "“Mukhtar” with Ramzi Binalshibh and Moussaoui."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        64.181950000000001,
        300.34704999999968,
        262.99860000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "10.August 2001: the CIA and FBI do not connect the presence of"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.783299999999997,
        289.09664999999967,
        250.37880000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Mihdhar, Hazmi, and Moussaoui to the general threat report-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        76.783299999999997,
        277.84624999999966,
        113.36397499999998,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "ing about imminent attacks."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.657799999999995,
        228.06302499999967,
        311.99565000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "responsible for making it work. Pavitt underscored the responsibility of the par-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.657799999999995,
        216.81262499999966,
        312.01922500000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "ticular field location where the suspects were being tracked at any given time."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.657799999999995,
        205.56222499999964,
        312.04382500000003,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "On the other hand, he also said that the Counterterrorist Center was supposed"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.658824999999993,
        194.31182499999963,
        312.04279999999994,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "to manage all the moving parts, while what happened on the ground was the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.657799999999995,
        183.06142499999962,
        159.02592500000003,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "responsibility of managers in the field.35"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        171.81425000000002,
        300.00110000000012,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Headquarters tended to support and facilitate, trying to make sure every-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        160.56385,
        312.02127500000012,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "one was in the loop. From time to time a particular post would push one way,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        149.31344999999999,
        312.02537500000005,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "or headquarters would urge someone to do something. But headquarters never"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659300000000002,
        138.06304999999998,
        312.03767499999992,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "really took responsibility for the successful management of this case. Hence the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659300000000002,
        126.81264999999996,
        312.09712500000012,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "managers at CIA headquarters did not realize that omissions in planning had"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659300000000002,
        115.56224999999996,
        254.51159999999996,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "occurred, and they scarcely knew that the case had fallen apart."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.65795,
        104.31184999999996,
        300.04005000000006,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "The director of the Counterterrorist Center at the time, Cofer Black,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659300000000002,
        93.061449999999965,
        312.01102500000013,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "recalled to us that this operation was one among many and that, at the time, it"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659300000000002,
        81.811049999999966,
        312.01204999999993,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "was “considered interesting, but not heavy water yet.” He recalled the failure"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        70.560649999999967,
        312.02127500000023,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "to get the word to Bangkok fast enough, but has no evident recollection of"
    },
